# Binary 3D assets are stored via Git LFS.
#
# A fresh clone REQUIRES git-lfs (https://git-lfs.com). Without it the .glb files are
# checked out as small text pointer files, and the game fails at load time with a
# GLTFLoader parse error that gives no hint about the real cause.
#
#   git lfs install          # once per machine
#   git clone <repo>         # then LFS pulls the real binaries automatically
#
# Regenerating the assets instead does not need LFS, but does need the Fiend write
# secret: npm run assets
*.glb filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
